/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3565878929","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112324#issuecomment-3565878929","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112324","id":3565878929,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uiv6R","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-22T07:00:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-22T07:00:25Z","body":"Just to throw in a few more ideas.\r\n\r\n1. Active tabs could have an extending radius at the bottom, thus giving the highlight more due to slight geometry overlap to a neighbouring inactive tab than due to colour.\r\n\r\n2. Instead of the \"separating\" bottom line suggested by DeeJayLSP, it could just underline the tab text instead and hence be more \"floaty\".\r\n\r\n3. In one of the bevy editor mock-ups, they used a vertical colour inside the tab. (This could clash with the node icons, though.)\r\n<img width=\"1902\" height=\"1062\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93e514ad-52aa-4af0-ad02-611de1895ce4\" />","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"h